# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Environment files: never commit real secrets, but keep the example template.
# The negation is load-bearing; without it a bare .env* silently swallows
# .env.example and the repo loses its only record of what keys are required.
.env*
!.env.example

# Claude Code personal settings. The .local suffix means machine-specific by
# convention, so this file should never be shared. Deliberately narrow: a broad
# .claude/ rule would also block a shared settings.json or project hooks, both
# of which are meant to be committed.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
